{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121164812794-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121172411\"/><p>餐廳冒出濃煙。</p><p>長沙灣發生火警。今午(21日)4時40分，元州街131號一間餐廳，廚房起火冒煙。消防員接報到場開喉灌救，迅速將火勢救熄。消息指，火警疑為爐頭搶火引致。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:43:55.467376+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:48:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:37:27.586371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:37:27.586371+00:00","content_hash":"3f2e9d885c68311c7ba3c7d2035570da6f1d00b6f280eaf7e0b22f07022649e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}